ment of clinically localized prostate cancer</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1994</year><volume>330</volume><fpage>242</fpage><lpage>248</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'N Engl J Med||330|242||bib4|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8272085</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Donovan</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamdy</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Neal</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Peters</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Oliver</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Brindle</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Jewell</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Powell</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Gillatt</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dedman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Mills</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Noble</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lane</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prostate testing for cancer and treatment (ProtecT) feasibility study</article-title><source>Health Technol Assess</source><year>2003</year><volume>7</volume><supplement>14</supplement><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>88</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Health Technol Assess||7|1||bib5|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Draisma</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Boer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Otto</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>van der Cruijsen</surname><given-names>IW</given-names></name><name><surname>D